Package: parkeze-dns
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, dnsmasq-full
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The gateway's resolver, as the site sets it.
 Upstream servers in place of the uplink's, local names the LAN resolves,
 and rebind protection with the domains allowed past it. Refuses names
 under Parkeze's domains and a server list that cannot resolve Parkeze.
 For boards with the dns feature; see boards/common/board.conf.
